「I can hear your voice, but there is no point in listening. 
　Words have no more weight between us; 
　our weapons will speak for us now!」

「The-O isn't just a Mobile Suit; 
　it's the most powerful mobile weapon ever created, 
　strengthened by technology from many different civilizations.」

「I'm afraid so. We came to Chongqing hoping
　we could find information on the Evolvers;
　it seems we wasted a trip.」

「Allow me to congratulate you, $c,
　for defeating not only Ende and Dyma, 
　but Nevanlinna as well.」

「Allow me to congratulate you, $c,
　for defeating not only Nevanlinna and Ende, 
　but Dyma as well.」

「Allow me to congratulate you, $c,
　for defeating not only Nevanlinna and Dyma, 
　but Ende as well.」

「Paptimus Scirocco! 
　Pretend to be the cool-headed tactician all you want; 
　in the end, you've still chosen power as your means of rule!」

「And I don't just mean in terms of public opinion;
　it's possible to fine-tune that control to thoughts
　and actions at an individual level.」

「Give me your power, o Willforce! 
　The power to destroy everything before me; 
　the power to change the future!」

「The answer is still out there! 
　We haven't reached it yet! But that's okay; 
　that's why Ryoma left you to the world!」

「Setting aside our personal feelings, 
　if fighting is the only way to solve this, 
　then we have to fight.」

「Doesn't matter how great or meager, 
　important or irrelevant they might be; 
　an enemy is an enemy. Remember that.」

「I let Lilis handle keepin' an eye on him
　while he's fighting, but I guarantee you,
　no one knows Daba better than me!」

「We will take our leave; 
　we have our own score to settle. 
　The rest is up to you.」

「There's no suggestion they have any ideals or policy goals; 
　just straight-up wannabe conquerors.
　Old-fashioned villains with no redeeming qualities.」

「There's no hint they have any ideals or policy goals; 
　just straight-up villains. Old-fashioned
　bad guys with no redeeming qualities.」

「You're pretty desperate to cling to your position
　for someone as smug and confident as you acted,
　oh high and mighty FORMER ruler.」

「He didn't just predict how they'd move; 
　he positioned those two so that they 
　could deal with whoever slipped through.」

「Normally, I would have saved this conversation
　for after you'd received proper medical attention,
　but given the circumstances...」

「You used the woman who loved you, ruled the world
　from the shadows, and after everyone abandoned you, 
　you want to destroy everything...」

（And yet I feel unsettled...
　Something's about to happen in this battle; 
　that much is certain.）
